`TrajectoryResult` keeps condition labels as given, so names such as `"fast-easy-right"` work alongside integers: per-condition and separation tables report them, and `filter(conditions=...)` and `permutation_null_separation_auc(group_a=..., group_b=...)` take them, raising on an unknown label. `TrajectoryResult.from_grid` builds the container from `(subject, condition, time, dim)` trajectories.
